        "original_id": "418ec962-1128-5045-a020-16362e17b195",
        "text": "This chunk compares a fictional character and a real person associated with the name Moe.\n\nThis chunk is about:\n- People: Moe Greene, Moe Dalitz, Mario Puzo\n- Works: The Godfather\n- Roles: fictional character, gangster, businessman, casino owner, philanthropist\n\nFacts:\n- In 1969, Mario Puzo's novel The Godfather included the fictional character Morris \"Moe\" Greene.\n- In 1972, the film adaptation The Godfather also featured the fictional character Morris \"Moe\" Greene.\n- Morris Barney Dalitz was born on December 25, 1899, and was known as Moe Dalitz.\n- Moe Dalitz was an American gangster, businessman, casino owner, and philanthropist.\n- Moe Dalitz died on August 31, 1989.",
